  "description": "In-process messaging for .NET: send a request to a single handler, publish a notification to many, stream results with IAsyncEnumerable, and wrap it all in a pipeline of behaviors, pre/post processors and exception handlers. A complete, MediatR-compatible API surface under the AspNetCore.Dispatcher namespace, with assembly scanning for Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.",
